Windows Registry Editor Version 5.00

; ============================================================
; Vortex Prime Custom Protocol Handler - UNINSTALLER
; ============================================================
;
; This script removes the "vortexprime://" custom URI scheme
; registration from your system.
;
; INSTRUCTIONS:
; 1. Save this file with a .reg extension
; 2. Right-click the file and select "Merge" (requires Admin privileges)
; 3. Click "Yes" on the UAC prompt and confirmation dialog
;
; ============================================================

[-HKEY_CLASSES_ROOT\vortexprime]
